## 4. CHRONO-EPISODIC MEMORIES & EXPERIENCES
{{#if hasEpisodicMemories}}
{{#each episodicMemories}}
- [Episode #{{id}}]: {{text}}
  - Confidence: {{formatDecimal ltpAdjustedDecay "%.2f"}} | Age: {{formatDecimal ageDays "%.1f"}}d
{{/each}}
{{else}}
- _No episodic memories recalled for prompt._
{{/if}}

{{#if hasFactHistories}}
## 5. BITEMPORAL EVIDENCE TRANSITIONS & CONFLICTS
{{#each factHistories}}
- [Timeline: `{{subject}}` -> `{{predicate}}`]:
{{#if activeFact}}
  - Active Consensus: `{{activeFact.object}}` (conf: {{formatDecimal activeFact.confidence "%.2f"}}, validFrom: {{activeFact.validFrom}})
{{/if}}
{{#each supersededFacts}}
  - Historical: `{{object}}` (conf: {{formatDecimal confidence "%.2f"}}, supersededBy: #{{supersededByFactId}})
{{/each}}
{{/each}}

